</div>
</div>
</div></ix:exclude>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>

<p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;">The change in accrued Super Biz Contingent Consideration, including the change in fair value measured using Level 1 inputs, as described at Note 2, and the related income statement impact for the periods presented was comprised of the following:</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>

