			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">In April 2023, the Company paid accrued contingent consideration related to the Initial Earn Out Period, comprised of $2.9 million of cash payments and payment of 987,973 shares of our common stock valued at $548,000.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

